  "title": "Tender Pork Spare Ribs",
  "description": "For spare ribs that fall off the bone, you&#39;ll need to cook them low and slow. So plan ahead. But these juicy and tender spare ribs are worth the wait!",
  "authors": [
    "Kerri Jaggers"
  ],
  "date_published": "2020-03-05T00:07:55-05:00",
  "date_modified": "2025-12-08T11:05:27-05:00",
  "prep_time": "PT20M",
  "cook_time": "PT240M",
  "total_time": "PT740M",
  "yield": [
    "8"
  ],
